gin Code Hosting, Cloud Agents Improvements, and iPad Support\",\n    \"description\": \"Cursor can now host your code with Origin repos and pull requests. Cloud agents start 3x faster with Builds, improved Google Workspace plugins integration, and Cursor for iPad is now available on all paid plans with inbox and review features.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-19\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Origin - Cursor's code hosting platform is now live!\",\n        \"source\": \"Reddit\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Grok 4.6 and Gemini 3.7 Flash available in Copilot\",\n    \"description\": \"New AI models Grok 4.6 and Gemini 3.7 Flash are now available in GitHub Copilot, providing developers with more model choices for AI-assisted coding.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog/\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-08-14\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"It's a great model, It is definitely smarter, but it seems to use more tokens and turns complete slower. This makes it somewhat awkward to use.\",\n        \"source\": \"X/Twitter\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"neutral\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Gemini-3.7-flash is surprisingly pleasant to use. I prefer it. It's fast and much better at UI.\",\n        \"source\": \"X/Twitter\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"my favorite model is still grok-4.6. Best...\",\n        \"source\": \"X/Twitter\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]",
