 <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Engineering intelligence platform for the AI coding era, helping teams cut AI spend by up to 30% while providing engineering insights.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">YC S26</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow-specific</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-20</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Helps teams cut AI spend by up to 30%\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49283100\" target=\"_blank\">Zenbu</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Terminal code tool - a VS Code-compatible CLI that runs inside your terminal over SSH, representing the code agent space.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">YC P26</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-19</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/microsoft/agent-lightning\" target=\"_blank\">Agent Lightning</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Microsoft's open-source reinforcement learning framework for AI agents, designed to help developers train agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">Microsoft</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-17</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49283063\" target=\"_blank\">Bullet</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Coding agent launched on Hacker News, founded by Adi and Alex, described as a faster coding agent that addresses slow performance of existing agents like Claude Code.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">YC S26</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-15</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Faster coding agent addressing Claude Code slowness\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/aia-vscode/\" target=\"_blank\">JetBrains AI Assistant for VS Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        JetBrains released a VS Code extension for their AI Assistant, empowered by a coding agent for complex tasks. Represents JetBrains' expansion beyond their own IDE ecosystem.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">JetBrains</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">IDE integration</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-14</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/ito-ai-code-review-that-runs-code\" target=\"_blank\">Ito</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI code review tool that runs your application before reviewing code, using ephemeral environments to validate impacted flows and return runtime evidence for pull requests.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow-specific</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-13</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"#4 of the Week for August 13th, 2026\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49185389\" target=\"_blank\">HyperProbe</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Tool that provides AI agents for read-only debugging in production environments, allowing developers to debug issues by chatting with coding agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">YC S26</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow-specific</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-12</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\" id=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    <a href=\"#whitelist-updates\">Product Updates</a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\" target=\"_blank\">Aider: Main branch updates - Claude 4.5/4.6, Gemini 2.5, DeepSeek Reasoner</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Added support for Claude 4.5/4.6 models, expanded Gemini model support with 2.5 Flash/Lite and 3 preview, added DeepSeek Reasoner model, and improved exception handling. Aider wrote 62% of the code in this release.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-25</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Codex CLI: Codex CLI 0.149.1 with agent dashboard and improvements</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New release adds interactive agents dashboard, working directory commands, queue for sessions, and expanded Vim editing. Includes bug fixes for queued messages, resumed sessions, and WebRTC connections.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Codex CLI: Codex MCP server command deprecated</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        The `codex mcp-server` command is now deprecated. Users should use the Codex app server instead, or the Codex plugin for Claude Code.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type announcement\">announcement</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot: New Copilot experience in Slack and Microsoft Teams</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        GitHub Copilot now brings shared agentic work to Slack and Microsoft Teams, allowing teams to collaborate with AI directly in their communication platforms.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-21</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Cursor: Origin Code Hosting, Cloud Agents Improvements, and iPad Support</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Cursor can now host your code with Origin repos and pull requests. Cloud agents start 3x faster with Builds, improved Google Workspace plugins integration, and Cursor for iPad is now available on all paid plans.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-19</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Origin - Cursor's code hosting platform is now live!\" - <span class=\"source-tag\">Reddit</span></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Copilot: Grok 4.6 and Gemini 3.7 Flash available in Copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New AI models Grok 4.6 and Gemini 3.7 Flash are now available in GitHub Copilot, providing developers with more model choices for AI-assisted coding.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">release</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-14</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Gemini-3.7-flash is surprisingly pleasant to use. I prefer it. It's fast and much better at UI.\" - <span class=\"source-tag\">X/Twitter</span></div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\" id=\"technical-insights\">\n                <div class=\"section-header\">\n                    <a href=\"#technical-insights\">Technical Insights</a>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48861923\" target=\"_blank\">Why write code in 2026</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Hacker News discussion on the role of manual coding in 2026. Covers debates on whether developers should still write code manually or rely entirely on AI agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">softwaredoug | HN</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-25</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"insight-points\">\n                        <li>Writing code helps build mental models - if you can't write code, you can't review it effectively</li>\n                        <li>Claude's hourly rate is ~$17, comparable to some human workers</li>\n                        <li>LLMs can write complex code like Prolog interpreters in WebAssembly successfully</li>\n                        <li>AI tools compress development timelines but don't eliminate the need for developers who understand fundamentals</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI coding</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">human vs AI</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">code review</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46923543\" target=\"_blank\">Coding agents have replaced every framework I used</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Hacker News discussion on replacing frameworks with AI-generated code and the implications for software architecture and maintainability.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">alainrk | HN</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"insight-points\">\n                        <li>AWS demo at re:Invent showed SRE agents autonomously detecting, triaging, and fixing bugs in 2 minutes</li>\n                        <li>Concern about 'vibe coding' leading to unmaintainable codebases when AI hits limitations</li>\n                        <li>Frameworks provide shared mental models that AI-generated bespoke code lacks</li>\n                        <li>Real-world experiment: team abandoned AI-generated system after months due to complexity and token costs</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">frameworks</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">architecture</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://blog.jetbrains.com/research/2026/08/ai-coding-agent-adoption-2026/\" target=\"_blank\">AI Coding Agents: Adoption Trends - The JetBrains Blog</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        JetBrains Developer Ecosystem Survey 2026 findings on AI coding agent adoption and market share statistics.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag source-tag\">JetBrains Research</span>\n                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-08-18</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"insight-points\">\n                        <li>90% of professional developers use AI coding agents at least weekly, with 68% using them daily</li>\n                        <li>Claude Code has become the most widely adopted tool at 39% of developers (up from 18% in January 2026)</li>\n                        <li>GitHub Copilot lost leadership, declining from 29% to 21% adoption</li>\n                        <li>Cursor declined from 18% to 12%, with significant drop in China</li>\n                    </ul>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">adoption statistics</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Claude Code</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">market share</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <p>Agentic Coding Research Report | Generated on August 25, 2026</p>\n            <p>\n                <a href=\"#new-products\">New Products</a> |\n                <a href=\"#whitelist-updates\">Updates</a> |\n                <a href=\"#technical-insights\">Insights</a>\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>"
